  "notes": "{納|おさ}める means to pay, deliver, or offer something to an authority, institution, or proper place.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Takes を particle\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {税金|ぜいきん}を{納|おさ}める: to pay taxes\n- {会費|かいひ}を{納|おさ}める: to pay membership dues\n- {品物|しなもの}を{納|おさ}める: to deliver goods\n- {神社|じんじゃ}に{納|おさ}める: to offer at a shrine\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {納税|のうぜい}: tax payment\n- {納品|のうひん}: delivery of goods\n- {納入|のうにゅう}: payment, delivery\n- {納得|なっとく}: consent, understanding\n\nHOMOPHONE DISTINCTION:\n- {納|おさ}める: to pay, deliver, offer\n- {治|おさ}める: to govern, rule, manage\n- {収|おさ}める: to obtain, store away\n- {修|おさ}める: to study, master",
